  "description": "WP-08 has no entries in 07_EVENT_CATALOGUE.yaml -- events derived directly from app/modules/ddcp/injector_commands.py's actual event_type= producer code. 10 events found: InjectorProfileDraftCreated, InjectorAssemblyOperationStarted, DrugContainerBound, InjectorAssemblyParameterRecorded, INJECTOR_TEST_FAILED, InjectorFunctionalTestCompleted (mutually exclusive outcomes of the same functional-test call site), DOSE_DELIVERY_FAILED, DoseDeliveryEvaluated (mutually exclusive outcomes of the same dose-delivery call site), InjectorUnitDispositioned, InjectorAssemblyCompleted, InjectorBatchEvidencePackageGenerated, ReusableDevicePairingRecorded. Note: 6 of this module's real events across the 4 DDCP files use SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE (INJECTOR_TEST_FAILED, DOSE_DELIVERY_FAILED, COATING_PARAMETER_EXCURSION, DRUG_LOADING_OOS, CLOSURE_TEST_FAILED, INHALER_QC_OOS) instead of this codebase's otherwise-universal PascalCase event naming convention -- a minor, low-severity inconsistency, included here factually rather than silently renamed to fit the convention.",
  "x-requirement-ids": [
    "INJ-FR-001",
    "INJ-FR-004",
    "INJ-FR-005",
    "INJ-FR-006",
    "INJ-FR-007",
    "INJ-FR-008",
    "INJ-FR-009",
    "INJ-FR-018"
  ],
